WEBVTT

01:32.094 --> 01:37.412
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.412 --> 01:40.359
[Episode 11]

01:40.359 --> 01:42.640
Wuniang, I miss you so much.

01:42.640 --> 01:43.959
Wuniang.

01:43.959 --> 01:45.120
I really miss you so much.

01:45.120 --> 01:47.040
- She's not Qin Wuniang.
- So many people here.

01:47.040 --> 01:48.159
I truly can't leave…

01:48.159 --> 01:49.448
Let her go.

01:51.640 --> 01:53.680
You are no longer Qin Wuniang.

01:53.680 --> 01:55.159
You are Qin Shengyi.

01:55.159 --> 01:56.879
Don't fear that man anymore.

01:57.719 --> 01:59.120
We are chatting.

01:59.120 --> 02:00.319
What does it have to do with you?

02:00.879 --> 02:02.079
That divorce agreement worth ten strings

02:02.079 --> 02:03.760
is still in my house.

02:03.760 --> 02:06.640
The person who has nothing
to do with Shengyi now is you.

02:07.560 --> 02:09.639
My lady, I was wrong.

02:09.639 --> 02:11.000
I have known my mistake.

02:11.000 --> 02:12.560
Do you really plan to

02:12.560 --> 02:14.400
go on without a home or husband?

02:15.919 --> 02:18.199
My lady, I truly can't leave you.

02:18.199 --> 02:20.159
I-I truly can't live without you.

02:20.159 --> 02:21.879
Of course, you can't live without her.

02:22.520 --> 02:25.400
Without her, no one would
work for you without complaint.

02:25.400 --> 02:27.439
Without her, no one would

02:27.439 --> 02:28.879
endure your beating.

02:29.719 --> 02:31.000
But without you,

02:31.000 --> 02:32.759
she will only get better and better,

02:32.759 --> 02:34.759
and her business will grow bigger and bigger.

02:34.759 --> 02:36.560
It was never her who needed you,

02:36.560 --> 02:38.439
but you who can't be without her.

02:41.560 --> 02:43.240
My lady.

02:43.240 --> 02:45.479
In the past, the business was bad,

02:45.479 --> 02:47.159
so I could only drown my sorrows in alcohol.

02:47.919 --> 02:49.080
But when I beat you,

02:49.719 --> 02:51.120
I felt painful.

02:51.800 --> 02:53.879
My lady, I was so sorry.

02:53.879 --> 02:54.879
I will never

02:54.879 --> 02:55.879
beat you again.

02:56.479 --> 02:57.639
Think about it.

02:57.639 --> 02:59.240
When we just got married,

02:59.240 --> 03:00.360
I treated you so well.

03:00.879 --> 03:03.400
We also had our harmonious days.

03:03.400 --> 03:04.439
He's said this to you

03:04.439 --> 03:05.719
more than once, hasn't he?

03:06.520 --> 03:08.439
A beast is a beast.

03:08.439 --> 03:09.840
How can it change its nature?

03:11.360 --> 03:12.639
Shengyi.

03:12.639 --> 03:14.719
Don't be fooled by his sweet-talking.

03:17.919 --> 03:19.360
You'd better go.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.800
Don't stay here

03:21.439 --> 03:23.159
and never come to me again.

03:23.159 --> 03:24.439
My lady.

03:24.439 --> 03:25.599
I really can't live without you.

03:25.599 --> 03:27.599
Get lost.

03:28.400 --> 03:29.896
Get lost.

03:35.919 --> 03:37.400
Don't be afraid. It's okay now.

03:40.439 --> 03:43.439
Xinfeng wine is free to try.

03:46.840 --> 03:48.479
- Lady, take the money.
- Okay.

03:48.479 --> 03:50.240
This is the second pot that I've bought.

03:50.240 --> 03:51.680
This flower is not easy to take care of.

03:51.680 --> 03:53.759
Here, take this. Come again next time.

03:53.759 --> 03:54.952
Okay.

03:55.599 --> 03:57.479
Don't water it too much.

03:57.479 --> 03:58.728
Alright.

04:00.639 --> 04:02.280
Fresh flowers newly arrived.

04:02.280 --> 04:04.719
Come and see the reasonably priced peony.

04:04.719 --> 04:06.840
My lady will surely be delighted.

04:08.360 --> 04:09.360
Come and take a look at the flowers.

04:13.480 --> 04:16.427
[Shengyi]

04:23.079 --> 04:24.600
Previously,

04:24.600 --> 04:26.480
I can never write my name properly.

04:28.279 --> 04:29.800
Today I met Wang Qing

04:29.800 --> 04:31.120
with frustrated look,

04:31.120 --> 04:33.399
I felt a bit of triumph.

04:34.600 --> 04:35.920
See,

04:35.920 --> 04:37.360
I can write it

04:37.360 --> 04:38.560
now.

04:39.560 --> 04:40.879
From now on,

04:40.879 --> 04:42.120
we will get better and better.

04:47.399 --> 04:48.879
Mudan.

04:48.879 --> 04:50.680
What kind of incense are you making?

04:51.519 --> 04:53.000
I've never seen it before.

04:53.839 --> 04:55.240
It's called Baikexiang.

04:55.240 --> 04:56.480
My mother taught me this.

04:57.279 --> 04:59.399
I can create different patterns

04:59.399 --> 05:00.879
according to personal preference.

05:01.920 --> 05:04.199
This incense can also tell time,

05:04.199 --> 05:05.360
and can be used

05:05.360 --> 05:06.800
to calm the mind when making it.

05:08.759 --> 05:11.160
We can't afford expensive incense powder,

05:11.160 --> 05:13.639
but we can still pursue some refined pleasures

05:14.160 --> 05:16.000
to make our days

05:16.000 --> 05:17.120
more exquisite.

05:23.709 --> 05:26.983
[Peace and Joy]

05:28.839 --> 05:30.248
Peace…

05:30.800 --> 05:31.880
Joy…

05:34.160 --> 05:35.600
What a great meaning.

05:36.360 --> 05:37.896
Here.

05:39.120 --> 05:41.079
You've worked so hard to make this incense.

05:41.079 --> 05:42.879
I must save it for a special day,

05:43.399 --> 05:45.680
otherwise, I won't burn it.

05:45.680 --> 05:46.759
If you don't

05:46.759 --> 05:48.279
burn it after being made,

05:48.279 --> 05:49.800
it would become a useless item.

05:49.800 --> 05:50.800
Don't worry.

05:50.800 --> 05:51.959
Making it

05:51.959 --> 05:53.319
already calms my mind.

05:53.920 --> 05:55.000
Use it.

05:55.000 --> 05:56.879
I'll make another for you
after you've used it up.

06:00.680 --> 06:01.759
Mudan.

06:01.759 --> 06:02.879
Wait for me.

06:17.199 --> 06:18.568
Mudan.

06:20.560 --> 06:21.879
Shengyi.

06:21.879 --> 06:23.304
This…

06:24.600 --> 06:26.959
I'm now living so fully and happily,

06:27.720 --> 06:28.959
all thanks to you.

06:29.639 --> 06:31.759
I have nothing of value to repay you,

06:32.600 --> 06:34.160
so I took the first money I earned

06:34.720 --> 06:35.920
and bought the cloths

06:35.920 --> 06:37.399
to make this dress.

06:37.399 --> 06:38.879
I hope you would like it.

06:44.120 --> 06:45.279
Your clothes are all torn,

06:45.839 --> 06:48.040
yet you still thought of
buying such a nice dress for me.

06:49.279 --> 06:51.639
Shengyi, thank you.

06:59.360 --> 07:01.879
- I will buy you clothes too.
- I…

07:01.879 --> 07:03.360
Let's take a day off tomorrow,

07:03.360 --> 07:04.560
and go out for a stroll.

07:04.560 --> 07:06.000
We've earned money,

07:06.000 --> 07:07.240
so we should go experience

07:07.240 --> 07:08.360
the prosperity of Chang'an.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.480
Okay.

07:10.480 --> 07:13.040
Youshi Hall facial cream nourishes the skin.

07:13.040 --> 07:14.240
Come on, Shengyi.

07:17.480 --> 07:19.040
Bravo!

07:21.680 --> 07:23.319
Bravo!

07:24.439 --> 07:25.480
One more.

07:26.759 --> 07:28.600
Bravo!

07:28.600 --> 07:29.600
Don't.

07:30.439 --> 07:33.360
Just watch. Save some money.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.800
Let's go look over there.

07:34.800 --> 07:36.040
Bravo!

07:36.040 --> 07:37.079
Well played.

07:39.959 --> 07:41.439
Bravo!

07:41.439 --> 07:42.959
Wishful sachet.

07:44.279 --> 07:45.704
Take a sniff.

07:46.600 --> 07:47.752
It smells good.

07:51.399 --> 07:52.439
For you.

07:52.439 --> 07:53.920
- Take care.
- Thank you, Mudan.

07:55.160 --> 07:56.319
Don't mention it.

07:56.959 --> 07:57.959
I'm glad you like it.

07:57.959 --> 07:58.959
It's really beautiful.

08:19.680 --> 08:20.680
Well drawn.

08:22.360 --> 08:24.279
I'd like to ask her to draw

08:24.279 --> 08:25.600
a portrait of my mother for me.

08:25.600 --> 08:26.639
Anyone you wish to draw?

08:26.639 --> 08:27.976
We can do it together.

08:29.680 --> 08:31.439
My father and mother

08:31.439 --> 08:33.159
are only doting on their son.

08:33.919 --> 08:36.480
In the entire family,
only my sixth brother is kind to me.

08:36.480 --> 08:37.960
Sixth brother?

08:37.960 --> 08:39.519
You have a younger brother?

08:39.519 --> 08:41.200
Why have you never told me?

08:42.440 --> 08:44.039
We haven't seen each other for a long time.

08:44.919 --> 08:47.039
Although my sixth brother
can't read, just like me,

08:47.039 --> 08:48.600
he is very clever and sensible.

08:49.279 --> 08:51.559
In order not to let my mother sell me,

08:51.559 --> 08:53.279
he himself was not in good health,

08:53.279 --> 08:55.360
but still went to the tavern
to help in the kitchen.

08:56.960 --> 08:58.720
When I got married,

08:58.720 --> 09:00.799
he was the only one in the family
who was reluctant to let me go,

09:00.799 --> 09:03.279
crying and asking me to go back often.

09:03.960 --> 09:06.320
But Wang Qing would not allow me to go back.

09:06.320 --> 09:08.600
I didn't see him once in two years.

09:12.279 --> 09:13.679
Now you are free.

09:13.679 --> 09:15.159
Whenever you want to see your younger brother,

09:15.159 --> 09:16.840
you can go back at any time.

09:17.759 --> 09:18.840
Indeed.

09:18.840 --> 09:19.919
I was thinking

09:19.919 --> 09:21.279
when I save up some more money,

09:21.279 --> 09:22.279
I could

09:22.279 --> 09:23.840
also bring him to Chang'an

09:24.600 --> 09:26.279
to live a good life.

09:26.279 --> 09:27.624
Okay.

09:28.360 --> 09:30.399
But for now, you can draw

09:30.399 --> 09:32.000
a picture of you two enjoying the flowers.

09:32.000 --> 09:33.200
When you miss him,

09:33.200 --> 09:34.600
you can look at it.

09:34.600 --> 09:36.279
When we make money

09:36.279 --> 09:37.519
and open a shop,

09:37.519 --> 09:39.279
then you can return home with money,

09:39.279 --> 09:40.360
showing off to those

09:40.360 --> 09:41.639
who looked down on you.

09:41.639 --> 09:43.039
Let them see how successful Shengyi is

09:43.039 --> 09:44.440
in Chang'an.

09:46.399 --> 09:47.944
Okay.

10:07.159 --> 10:08.240
That's amazing? See.

10:08.240 --> 10:10.320
Look at mine. It's not growing well.

10:10.320 --> 10:11.799
- Selling inferior flowers.
- Right.

10:14.399 --> 10:16.240
- Mine is the same.
- Everyone.

10:16.240 --> 10:17.559
Everyone, what happened?

10:17.559 --> 10:19.080
It's her.

10:19.080 --> 10:21.480
It's this evil woman

10:21.480 --> 10:23.360
intentionally selling us the sick flowers.

10:25.519 --> 10:26.720
Everyone,

10:26.720 --> 10:28.279
when the Huaixiuxiang was sold,

10:28.279 --> 10:29.759
it was definitely not sick.

10:29.759 --> 10:31.200
There must be some misunderstanding.

10:31.200 --> 10:33.200
Who can tell me what exactly happened?

10:33.200 --> 10:34.440
- You…
- Everyone, please make way.

10:35.080 --> 10:36.559
When you just set up your stall,

10:36.559 --> 10:37.879
I bought this flower.

10:37.879 --> 10:39.200
But it's withered within four days.

10:39.840 --> 10:41.080
My wife

10:41.080 --> 10:42.519
scolded me for not taking good care of it.

10:43.200 --> 10:45.159
A couple of days ago, I bought another pot.

10:45.159 --> 10:47.320
Look at this pot now.

10:47.320 --> 10:48.960
I'm afraid it's about to wilt again.

10:48.960 --> 10:50.472
I'll take a look.

10:53.159 --> 10:54.960
You must water it too much.

10:54.960 --> 10:56.360
The water collects at the root.

10:56.360 --> 10:57.960
You can give me this flower.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.320
I can revive it

10:59.320 --> 11:01.440
and return a healthy one to you tomorrow.

11:01.440 --> 11:02.960
But this other one

11:02.960 --> 11:04.399
is completely withered.

11:04.399 --> 11:05.799
I can't do anything to save it.

11:05.799 --> 11:07.919
Can you tell me how you cared for it before?

11:07.919 --> 11:09.039
Well…

11:09.639 --> 11:11.759
Your flower had a problem,

11:11.759 --> 11:13.320
yet you're blaming us.

11:13.840 --> 11:16.480
If one or two people didn't care for it well,

11:16.480 --> 11:18.240
but so many flowers are withered,

11:18.759 --> 11:20.600
don't try to shirk the responsibility.

11:20.600 --> 11:23.559
Lady, I bought

11:23.559 --> 11:25.919
this flower when you just started your stall.

11:25.919 --> 11:26.960
You said

11:26.960 --> 11:28.720
that the flower would bloom for half a month.

11:28.720 --> 11:30.360
Look, the situation of the others

11:30.360 --> 11:32.320
- is similar to mine.
- Yes.

11:32.320 --> 11:34.639
No one's flowers survive more than ten days.

11:34.639 --> 11:36.759
We hope you can give us an explanation.

11:37.600 --> 11:39.600
Madam, flowers are living things.

11:39.600 --> 11:41.039
There are many reasons for wilting.

11:41.039 --> 11:42.639
I must check them one by one.

11:42.639 --> 11:43.679
Let me check on your flower.

11:44.399 --> 11:46.000
Cut the chatter.

11:46.000 --> 11:47.639
The flower is dead.

11:47.639 --> 11:48.919
What else is there to see?

11:48.919 --> 11:50.759
- Refund.
- Refund.

11:50.759 --> 11:51.720
- Right.
- Refund.

11:51.720 --> 11:53.600
Are you trying to pass the buck?

11:53.600 --> 11:56.000
Are you trying to shrink responsibility
and not refund our money?

11:56.000 --> 11:57.440
I have no such intention.

11:57.440 --> 11:58.679
Please listen to me.

11:58.679 --> 12:00.399
Don't listen to her.

12:00.919 --> 12:03.240
Selling inferior flowers, cheating the people.

12:03.240 --> 12:04.559
and refusing to refund the money.

12:05.159 --> 12:06.759
Today, we must teach her a lesson.

12:06.759 --> 12:08.279
- Exactly.
- Smash her stall.

12:08.279 --> 12:08.799
- Smash it.
- Right.

12:08.799 --> 12:11.080
- Smash it
- Smash it.

12:11.080 --> 12:12.200
- Don't smash my flowers.
- Get out of the way.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.320
If no refund, then smash everything.

12:13.320 --> 12:15.200
- Don't smash my flowers.
- Smash them all.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.240
Give me a refund.

12:18.320 --> 12:20.000
- Smash the flowers.
- Stop it.

12:20.000 --> 12:21.200
- Stop it
- Smash them!

12:21.200 --> 12:23.000
- Smash them!
- Stop it.

12:23.000 --> 12:24.720
- Don't smash my flowers.
- Stop it.

12:24.720 --> 12:26.480
- Move!
- You can't smash them.

12:26.480 --> 12:28.440
All of these are our effort.

12:28.440 --> 12:29.399
- Don't smash.
- Go away.

12:29.399 --> 12:30.639
- Shengyi.
- Mudan.

12:30.639 --> 12:31.879
- Are you okay?
- Move.

12:41.759 --> 12:42.840
Stop smashing.

12:42.840 --> 12:45.480
I'll refund.

12:46.600 --> 12:47.759
So many flowers.

12:47.759 --> 12:49.879
If we refund them all,
our business will be ruined.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.000
Customers,

13:01.000 --> 13:02.159
I know as a merchant,

13:02.159 --> 13:03.840
if one wishes to last long in business,

13:03.840 --> 13:05.080
one must value reputation.

13:05.639 --> 13:08.279
I didn't mean to cause this.

13:08.279 --> 13:09.399
But since you bought the flowers

13:09.399 --> 13:11.039
from me,

13:11.039 --> 13:12.639
I will certainly take full responsibility.

13:13.519 --> 13:15.039
The peony flowers may be withered,

13:15.039 --> 13:16.600
but my character will not.

13:18.039 --> 13:19.200
I assure all of you,

13:20.039 --> 13:22.200
just return your Huaixiuxiang to me,

13:22.200 --> 13:24.600
Once I clear the stock and recover the funds,

13:24.600 --> 13:25.879
I'll return all the money for the flowers

13:25.879 --> 13:28.039
to you all.

13:28.039 --> 13:29.399
None of us is wealthy,

13:29.399 --> 13:30.879
we are all needing money.

13:30.879 --> 13:32.600
Why should we wait for you?

13:32.600 --> 13:34.519
Refund it today.

13:34.519 --> 13:36.159
Yes, refund it today.

13:36.159 --> 13:37.320
Refund it all today.

13:37.320 --> 13:38.639
We don't have much money left.

13:38.639 --> 13:40.440
The next batch of flowers
is still being cultivated.

13:40.440 --> 13:42.080
Okay.

13:42.080 --> 13:43.200
I will refund it all today.

13:43.840 --> 13:45.519
Please wait here.

13:45.519 --> 13:46.759
I'll go back to get the money now.

13:47.399 --> 13:48.679
If you run away,

13:48.679 --> 13:50.879
then what should we do?

13:50.879 --> 13:51.919
I won't do so.

13:52.559 --> 13:54.600
We must take them back with us,

13:54.600 --> 13:56.759
watch them take out the money.

13:56.759 --> 14:01.039
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

14:01.039 --> 14:02.080
- Shengyi.
- Let's go.

14:02.080 --> 14:02.840
- Let's go.
- Hurry.

14:02.840 --> 14:04.080
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

14:04.600 --> 14:07.240
- Hurry up.
- What's wrong?

14:07.240 --> 14:08.519
Everyone, look.

14:09.120 --> 14:12.159
Dishonest traders are selling inferior goods.

14:12.159 --> 14:14.399
Everyone, remember them.

14:14.399 --> 14:16.159
Don't be deceived by them again.

14:16.759 --> 14:18.960
- Women are no good at business.
- You!

14:18.960 --> 14:20.440
Going outside all day long,

14:20.440 --> 14:21.919
how can they be considered nice women?

14:21.919 --> 14:22.919
The authorities should have

14:22.919 --> 14:24.360
caught them and locked them up.

14:24.360 --> 14:25.960
This is going too far.

14:25.960 --> 14:27.279
Wang Qing leading the trouble

14:27.279 --> 14:28.879
is all my fault.

14:28.879 --> 14:30.600
It's my fault, Mudan.

14:32.840 --> 14:34.216
It's alright.

14:34.799 --> 14:36.679
It's just a few rumors.

14:36.679 --> 14:38.480
When we restore our reputation later,

14:38.480 --> 14:39.720
we will surely change everyone's view.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.759
Don't worry. Calm down.

14:44.360 --> 14:45.480
- What are you doing?
- Hurry up.

14:45.480 --> 14:46.600
Don't dilly-dally.

14:46.600 --> 14:47.600
Are you thinking of running away?

14:47.600 --> 14:48.960
Just follow them and get the money back.

14:48.960 --> 14:50.080
Hurry up.

14:50.080 --> 14:51.320
- Don't push her.
- Everyone, come and watch.

14:51.919 --> 14:55.200
Dishonest traders are selling inferior goods.

14:55.200 --> 14:58.120
Everyone, remember them.

14:58.120 --> 14:59.639
Don't be deceived by them again.

15:06.279 --> 15:07.519
My lord.

15:07.519 --> 15:09.399
I can kill the fish.

15:10.080 --> 15:11.720
But I really can't

15:12.440 --> 15:14.279
tease the fish.

15:14.279 --> 15:15.679
I've been teasing this fish for half a day,

15:15.679 --> 15:17.679
but I haven't even seen it at all.

15:18.279 --> 15:19.559
What's so special about this fish anyway?

15:20.840 --> 15:22.919
This governor of Yuanzhou

15:22.919 --> 15:25.120
specially presented this gold carp,

15:25.120 --> 15:26.399
begging me to offer it to His Majesty.

15:27.080 --> 15:28.399
He said it's entirely golden,

15:28.399 --> 15:29.720
with dragon patterns on its belly,

15:29.720 --> 15:31.120
which is a sign of good omen.

15:31.960 --> 15:34.240
This fish is timid and easily frightened,

15:34.240 --> 15:35.879
always hiding under the rocks.

15:35.879 --> 15:37.879
If you want to see it first,

15:37.879 --> 15:40.440
well, let's not make any noise

15:40.440 --> 15:41.840
and wait quietly.

16:02.639 --> 16:03.679
Hurry up.

16:03.679 --> 16:05.679
Don't dilly-dally.

16:05.679 --> 16:07.720
Don't try to run away. We're all watching.

16:07.720 --> 16:09.000
Back yard again?

16:09.720 --> 16:11.159
The evil neighbor disturbs me.

16:11.159 --> 16:12.559
According to law,
how much fine should be imposed?

16:13.360 --> 16:14.559
Hurry up, thinking of running away?

16:14.559 --> 16:16.720
Don't touch her anymore.

16:16.720 --> 16:17.879
The people living nearby

16:17.879 --> 16:19.399
are all high officials and nobles.

16:19.399 --> 16:20.559
Making a commotion here

16:20.559 --> 16:22.240
might not be good.

16:22.240 --> 16:23.840
What's there to fear?

16:23.840 --> 16:25.519
She's not from a noble or wealthy family.

16:25.519 --> 16:27.200
We're here to get our money back
from the dishonest traders.

16:27.200 --> 16:29.720
- Shengyi.
- If the officials come, we are still in the right.

16:31.039 --> 16:34.360
Everyone, I never go back on my promise.

16:34.360 --> 16:35.559
I'm going in to get the money.

16:35.559 --> 16:37.039
Please wait here.

16:40.000 --> 16:41.919
You can climb walls.

16:41.919 --> 16:43.519
If you run away, whom shall we find?

16:44.360 --> 16:45.720
I'll stay here and wait with you.

16:46.360 --> 16:47.559
Rest assured.

16:48.120 --> 16:50.639
Since she has said she will give a refund,

16:50.639 --> 16:52.679
we don't need to be aggressive here.

16:53.559 --> 16:55.279
This is her house.

16:55.279 --> 16:57.000
If we barge in by force,

16:57.000 --> 16:58.399
even a justified cause will seem unjustified.

16:59.320 --> 17:01.000
If she reports it to the yamen,

17:01.000 --> 17:02.960
we may even end up being beaten with sticks.

17:02.960 --> 17:05.440
- Right.
- We should just wait here.

17:05.440 --> 17:07.720
- Yes.
- Lady, hurry up.

17:09.440 --> 17:10.599
Thank you.

17:10.599 --> 17:12.000
- Hurry.
- Go.

17:13.400 --> 17:14.519
Go.

17:14.519 --> 17:16.440
Shengyi, assign numbers to them.

17:16.440 --> 17:18.160
I'm going in to get the money.

17:18.160 --> 17:19.720
The madam who just spoke up for us

17:19.720 --> 17:21.400
is a kind person.

17:21.400 --> 17:22.680
If Wang Qing starts trouble again,

17:22.680 --> 17:24.720
ask her to speak for us.

17:25.599 --> 17:26.888
Don't be afraid.

17:38.720 --> 17:40.039
Understood, leave.

17:43.200 --> 17:44.480
My lord.

17:44.480 --> 17:46.759
All the flowers sold by Lady He have withered,

17:46.759 --> 17:48.319
and her customers are causing trouble here.

17:48.319 --> 17:49.640
She agreed to refund the money,

17:49.640 --> 17:51.160
asking them to wait outside.

17:52.400 --> 17:54.056
Refund?

17:55.559 --> 17:57.640
Then I'll lose my capital.

17:59.519 --> 18:00.559
After she went back,

18:00.559 --> 18:03.759
the group of people outside
have been shouting nonstop.

18:03.759 --> 18:04.960
I'm afraid they will barge in

18:04.960 --> 18:05.960
and do some aggro.

18:06.559 --> 18:08.039
It would be good if she could be unharmed.

18:08.039 --> 18:10.839
Yet you still only care about money.

18:10.839 --> 18:13.279
My lord, you are truly cruel.

18:14.279 --> 18:16.279
I'm flattered.

18:16.279 --> 18:18.160
He Weifang is cunning and shrewd,

18:18.160 --> 18:19.160
treasuring money as life.

18:20.079 --> 18:21.720
No one could make her suffer a loss.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.720
How long has she been back in her house?

18:28.319 --> 18:29.559
Has she run away?

19:17.160 --> 19:19.400
It's normal for these flowers to wither.

19:19.400 --> 19:20.759
Ignorant women!

19:20.759 --> 19:22.759
- What good can they possibly grow?
- Exactly.

19:22.759 --> 19:25.240
This woman doesn't know how to grow flowers.

19:25.240 --> 19:26.599
Why selling flower?

19:26.599 --> 19:27.640
Might as well sell her body.

19:30.440 --> 19:31.720
Exactly.

19:31.720 --> 19:34.039
A pot of flowers costs eighty wens.

19:34.759 --> 19:36.599
It withers after just a few days of care.

19:36.599 --> 19:38.079
She's so despicable and unreliable.

19:38.079 --> 19:39.680
Right, despicable and unreliable.

19:39.680 --> 19:42.880
This is not a peony at all.

19:43.400 --> 19:45.200
We have been deceived by this woman.

19:45.200 --> 19:46.759
Right, she is a swindle.

19:46.759 --> 19:48.240
Don't ever again

19:48.240 --> 19:50.039
trust these indecent women again.

19:50.720 --> 19:51.960
She's disobedient

19:51.960 --> 19:53.359
and committing fraud.

19:54.160 --> 19:56.160
Stop slandering Mudan.

19:56.160 --> 19:58.519
Qin Wuniang, she is so cunning.

19:58.519 --> 20:00.400
I know

20:00.400 --> 20:02.319
you have learned from a bad example.

20:03.240 --> 20:04.599
Today,

20:04.599 --> 20:06.519
if she can't get the money,

20:06.519 --> 20:08.160
then we'll smash this place up.

20:08.160 --> 20:10.000
- Right, smash it up.
- Everyone, go in and smash it.

20:10.000 --> 20:12.000
- Let's smash it.
- Smash it.

20:12.000 --> 20:13.960
Just a pot of flowers, it's not worth it.

20:13.960 --> 20:15.920
The neighbors are all nobles.

20:15.920 --> 20:21.032
[Peace and Joy]

20:22.824 --> 20:29.320
♫ Smiling as the storm stir the dust ♫

20:29.320 --> 20:33.271
♫ Flowers should bloom proudly ♫

20:33.271 --> 20:34.984
♫ Reflecting the color of the sky ♫

20:34.984 --> 20:36.872
♫ Never withering ♫

20:36.872 --> 20:42.888
♫ Do not fail the varied fragrance ♫

20:51.799 --> 20:53.640
Mother.

20:54.599 --> 20:56.079
Wait for this incense to burn out,

20:58.200 --> 20:59.920
I will go handle it myself.

21:03.240 --> 21:06.881
♫ Flowers should bloom proudly ♫

21:06.881 --> 21:09.245
♫ Reflecting the color of the sky ♫

21:09.245 --> 21:11.296
♫ Never withering ♫

21:11.296 --> 21:15.079
♫ Do not fail the varied fragrance ♫

21:15.079 --> 21:16.599
I can't wait any longer.

21:16.599 --> 21:18.680
If she doesn't come out, don't blame me.

21:18.680 --> 21:19.759
Mudan.

21:19.759 --> 21:20.920
Wait no more.

21:20.920 --> 21:22.319
- Smash it.
- Right.

21:22.319 --> 21:23.039
- Smash it and enter.
- Right.

21:23.039 --> 21:24.640
The commotion from outside is growing louder.

21:24.640 --> 21:26.319
I can hardly hold them back anymore.

21:26.319 --> 21:27.559
How's it going?

21:27.559 --> 21:29.319
Does she need my help?

21:29.319 --> 21:30.799
She'll be out soon.

21:30.799 --> 21:31.799
You go find the account book first,

21:31.799 --> 21:33.000
so you can check the accounts later.

21:34.119 --> 21:35.240
Is she alright?

21:36.079 --> 21:37.160
Very well.

21:37.160 --> 21:38.640
She is someone

21:38.640 --> 21:40.640
who can solve everything. Go ahead.

21:41.440 --> 21:43.079
- Open the door.
- Hurry up and open it.

21:43.079 --> 21:44.079
Open the door.

21:44.079 --> 21:45.759
- We've been waiting for so long.
- What are you doing?

21:46.440 --> 21:48.400
If you don't have money, just come out
and follow us to the yamen.

21:48.400 --> 21:49.960
Who knows what she's doing in there?

21:50.559 --> 21:52.279
She might have escaped.

21:52.799 --> 21:54.359
Please wait a moment longer.

21:54.359 --> 21:57.160
My lord, it's Lady Qin's ex-husband
who's instigating this event.

21:57.160 --> 21:58.480
He deliberately incited
customers to cause trouble.

22:00.240 --> 22:01.880
Everyone, smash the door.

22:01.880 --> 22:02.960
- Go.
- Don't.

22:02.960 --> 22:03.976
- Smash it.
- Calm down.

22:03.976 --> 22:05.400
She must have run off with the money.

22:05.400 --> 22:06.839
- Mudan is coming out.
- Move.

22:07.440 --> 22:09.559
- Check if there's a back door.
- Mudan is gathering the money.

22:09.559 --> 22:10.880
- Move.
- Don't rush, wait a bit longer.

22:10.880 --> 22:11.599
- Move.
- Go away.

22:11.599 --> 22:14.240
Wang Qing, if you hate me, just come at me.

22:14.240 --> 22:15.720
Don't take it out on others.

22:15.720 --> 22:17.240
That wretch coaxed you into leaving me,

22:17.240 --> 22:18.480
I won't let her go.

22:19.079 --> 22:21.640
Unless you are willing to come back
and live with me.

22:21.640 --> 22:23.240
Impossible.

22:25.759 --> 22:26.880
Make way!

22:26.880 --> 22:28.160
Why standing there?

22:28.160 --> 22:29.400
Don't think that hiding in there

22:29.400 --> 22:30.720
means all is well.

22:30.720 --> 22:31.799
Everyone, come with me and charge in.

22:31.799 --> 22:34.240
Take away all the valuable things in the house.

22:34.240 --> 22:35.400
To get back our money.

22:35.400 --> 22:36.119
- That's right.
- Let's go.

22:36.119 --> 22:37.319
- Hurry.
- My lord.

22:37.319 --> 22:40.000
- Stop.
- You really just watch by and not helping?

22:41.200 --> 22:42.920
The commotion in Luoyang is bigger than this.

22:43.880 --> 22:46.279
- Mudan can handle this.
- Move.

22:46.279 --> 22:47.752
Stop!

22:58.039 --> 22:59.559
I already get the money.

23:01.039 --> 23:02.279
Who overturned the table just now?

23:03.519 --> 23:05.119
The teacup is worth ten wens,

23:05.119 --> 23:06.119
and the table fifty wens.

23:06.680 --> 23:08.200
I will deduct it from his spending money.

23:08.960 --> 23:10.000
Who else wants to smash it?

23:10.519 --> 23:11.912
Please feel free.

23:12.559 --> 23:14.240
Who are you trying to scare?

23:14.240 --> 23:15.519
Smashing a dishonest trader's things

23:15.519 --> 23:17.400
is to uphold justice.

23:17.400 --> 23:18.480
To uphold justice?

23:19.079 --> 23:20.799
So it will give you money?

23:22.759 --> 23:24.119
Just now at my flower stall,

23:24.119 --> 23:25.559
the peonies you smashed

23:25.559 --> 23:26.839
all must be compensated for at the set price.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.960
If it goes to the yamen,

23:28.960 --> 23:30.440
I'm afraid
the compensation will be even greater.

23:30.440 --> 23:31.480
- I told you.
- She wouldn't deceive others.

23:31.480 --> 23:32.960
- You didn't smash it just now, did you?
- Everyone.

23:33.920 --> 23:35.440
Wang Qing has a personal grudge against me,

23:35.960 --> 23:37.920
so he incited you all
to come here and cause trouble.

23:37.920 --> 23:39.400
Don't be used by him.

23:39.960 --> 23:41.319
Just listen to me

23:41.319 --> 23:42.640
and don't act rashly.

23:42.640 --> 23:44.799
You will get back the refund money.

23:45.480 --> 23:46.799
I want

23:46.799 --> 23:47.880
to run the business

23:47.880 --> 23:49.160
for a long time.

23:49.160 --> 23:50.880
I also want to make friends with you.

23:51.559 --> 23:52.960
Harmony brings wealth to all.

23:52.960 --> 23:54.039
Everyone,

23:54.039 --> 23:55.240
please think it carefully.

23:56.039 --> 23:57.279
I knew it.

23:57.279 --> 23:58.799
This lady will keep her word.

23:58.799 --> 23:59.920
What are you making a fuss about?

24:00.839 --> 24:02.039
Exactly.

24:03.200 --> 24:04.759
Madam, you go first.

24:09.119 --> 24:10.640
The show is over, let's go.

24:10.640 --> 24:11.880
Here is your money. Take it.

24:11.880 --> 24:13.384
Do I let you go?

24:13.920 --> 24:15.559
In the backyard of the Jiang Mansion,

24:15.559 --> 24:16.960
a group of people barged in

24:16.960 --> 24:18.000
and even smashed the door.

24:18.559 --> 24:20.559
If any flowers, tiles,

24:20.559 --> 24:21.720
or walls get damaged,

24:21.720 --> 24:22.880
this money for the repairs

24:22.880 --> 24:23.880
will be deducted from your monthly salary.

24:24.799 --> 24:26.280
No, My lord.

24:28.039 --> 24:29.512
Next, please.

24:30.680 --> 24:32.039
I have two pots.

24:32.039 --> 24:34.599
I remember you. You've bought flowers twice.

24:34.599 --> 24:35.880
- Here, for you.
- Thank you

24:36.920 --> 24:38.880
She has the current situation under control,

24:40.000 --> 24:41.599
and we can't turn the tide anymore.

24:42.200 --> 24:43.240
We must find another way.

24:44.079 --> 24:45.440
Rest assured.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.759
During the mess just now,

24:47.359 --> 24:49.480
I've obtained
Qin Wuniang's personal belongings.

24:50.160 --> 24:51.680
I'm used to doing such things,

24:52.240 --> 24:53.400
and I will not fail again.

25:03.920 --> 25:05.119
You, being an auspicious object,

25:05.119 --> 25:06.359
are yet so timid,

25:07.440 --> 25:09.440
hiding away at the slightest fright.

25:10.240 --> 25:11.359
You can't achieve anything.

25:33.440 --> 25:34.839
I know someone

25:36.480 --> 25:38.039
who feels fear and cries,

25:39.240 --> 25:40.960
yet always faces difficulties,

25:40.960 --> 25:41.960
never backing down.

25:45.279 --> 25:46.880
How about I take you to learn from her?

26:00.319 --> 26:01.759
Crying secretly again.

26:02.680 --> 26:04.240
Why do I keep seeing you like this?

26:18.559 --> 26:19.920
After all this,

26:19.920 --> 26:21.160
you don't cry or fuss,

26:21.160 --> 26:22.799
nor ask me for additional money,

26:22.799 --> 26:23.799
yet you still

26:23.799 --> 26:25.039
tidy up these withered flowers.

26:26.079 --> 26:28.079
Jiang Xiaohua, your resilience

26:28.079 --> 26:29.519
is far greater than that of your flowers.

26:32.160 --> 26:33.799
The business has encountered such a setback.

26:35.720 --> 26:37.079
I have failed your expectations.

26:41.599 --> 26:44.000
You promised me

26:44.000 --> 26:45.960
that you would yield great profits for me.

26:46.559 --> 26:48.440
You made your promise.

26:49.960 --> 26:52.000
It's not the small amount of money
that disappoints me,

26:52.000 --> 26:53.440
but as the Floral Envoy,

26:54.039 --> 26:55.160
I have misjudged.

26:57.759 --> 26:59.400
You haven't misjudged

26:59.400 --> 27:00.720
my talent in caring flowers.

27:01.240 --> 27:02.519
The failure now

27:02.519 --> 27:04.680
is all because I was being smug.

27:06.960 --> 27:07.960
Why would you say that?

27:09.319 --> 27:11.160
When I dug up these flowers from the mountain,

27:11.799 --> 27:12.920
I knew

27:12.920 --> 27:14.839
it would hurt them.

27:14.839 --> 27:16.359
But I had previously

27:16.359 --> 27:18.720
successfully transplanted multiple times,

27:18.720 --> 27:21.799
so I ignored my inexperience
with mountain flowers,

27:21.799 --> 27:23.759
thinking that with my own skills

27:23.759 --> 27:25.279
and good fertilization and irrigation,

27:25.279 --> 27:26.920
I could minimize the damage.

27:28.240 --> 27:29.559
Unfortunately,

27:29.559 --> 27:31.440
I failed to consider the subsequent growth.

27:32.839 --> 27:34.359
Now, to refund the money

27:34.359 --> 27:36.240
to the customers is only right.

27:40.519 --> 27:42.920
I also feel ashamed of your investment.

27:43.960 --> 27:46.200
If you wish to take back your capital

27:46.200 --> 27:47.400
and withdraw from this deal,

27:48.400 --> 27:49.800
I accept it.

27:52.119 --> 27:54.119
You've nearly spent all your money.

27:55.039 --> 27:56.776
How will you compensate me?

28:02.119 --> 28:03.599
The ladies of Huanyun Tower

28:03.599 --> 28:04.640
all know

28:04.640 --> 28:05.880
that there's
a clever-tongued flower-selling woman

28:05.880 --> 28:07.519
living in my backyard.

28:08.119 --> 28:09.319
If I forced you to dead end

28:09.319 --> 28:10.880
for some petty money,

28:10.880 --> 28:13.559
it would ruin my reputation
for cherishing beauty.

28:15.359 --> 28:16.480
In business,

28:16.480 --> 28:17.839
one must not only
seek profit for profit's sake.

28:17.839 --> 28:18.920
Honesty should be prioritized.

28:19.480 --> 28:20.519
Since you

28:20.519 --> 28:22.160
have invested in my business,

28:22.160 --> 28:24.920
I must take responsibility for your money.

28:25.880 --> 28:27.440
Once I've earned back the capital,

28:27.440 --> 28:28.480
I will immediately repay you.

28:32.319 --> 28:34.000
Doing business is like warfare.

28:34.000 --> 28:35.279
Victory and defeat are common.

28:36.200 --> 28:37.400
With lessons,

28:37.400 --> 28:38.400
just improve yourself.

28:39.599 --> 28:40.680
I invested money in you

28:40.680 --> 28:42.599
to turn one hundred strings
into tens of thousands strings.

28:43.119 --> 28:44.599
If I only get back the capital

28:44.599 --> 28:45.880
and severe our cooperation,

28:45.880 --> 28:48.279
to me, it is a loss.

28:50.400 --> 28:51.599
Yes.

28:52.119 --> 28:53.839
Mr. Jiang, you have long-term vision.

28:53.839 --> 28:55.720
I will certainly not fail your trust.

28:57.839 --> 28:59.279
Mr. Jiang, look.

29:01.039 --> 29:03.559
This patch is the new breed
of peonies I've cultivated.

29:04.319 --> 29:05.759
This kind of flower boasts a unique color,

29:05.759 --> 29:07.759
but it's very difficult to blossom.

29:07.759 --> 29:09.400
Thus, the purchase price is not high.

29:09.400 --> 29:11.960
However, I have already improved this flaw,

29:11.960 --> 29:13.839
and have named it Chunyiwan.

29:15.599 --> 29:17.319
I don't care what color it is.

29:17.319 --> 29:18.440
I just want

29:18.440 --> 29:19.640
you to make money for me.

29:20.680 --> 29:22.160
Yes, yes.

29:22.160 --> 29:23.880
The Chunyiwan has a long blooming period

29:23.880 --> 29:26.359
and it can bloom until the peonies go on sale.

29:26.359 --> 29:27.359
After autumn comes,

29:27.359 --> 29:29.759
I will pick another batch of good seedlings,

29:29.759 --> 29:31.200
and start cultivating them from scratch.

29:31.200 --> 29:33.079
There will be no further risk of transplanting.

29:34.480 --> 29:36.400
Then I'll count on you

29:36.400 --> 29:37.400
for my next month's drinking money.

29:38.319 --> 29:39.464
No problem.

29:40.400 --> 29:43.400
But there's another compensation

29:43.400 --> 29:44.680
that you need to make up for me today.

29:46.319 --> 29:48.200
What is it?

29:48.200 --> 29:50.039
I got a golden carp.

29:50.039 --> 29:51.440
Seeing it brings good luck.

29:52.359 --> 29:53.400
But

29:53.400 --> 29:55.039
it's timid and easily frightened.

29:55.039 --> 29:56.519
I've been watching it all day,

29:56.519 --> 29:58.079
and it was about to come out.

29:58.079 --> 30:00.160
But it was scared back
by the noise in your backyard.

30:00.880 --> 30:02.599
Tell me, how will you compensate me?

30:04.480 --> 30:06.160
Mr. Jiang,

30:06.160 --> 30:08.720
why are you considerate at times,

30:08.720 --> 30:11.039
yet unreasonable at others?

30:11.039 --> 30:12.839
What does this fish have to do with me?

30:13.480 --> 30:14.480
Let's deal with it one by one.

30:15.119 --> 30:16.880
This is a fish to be offered to His Majesty.

30:17.440 --> 30:19.048
You'd handle it yourself.

30:23.480 --> 30:25.400
Raising fish is similar to caring flowers.

30:26.200 --> 30:28.200
The most important thing
is a suitable environment.

30:30.440 --> 30:31.920
This fish

30:31.920 --> 30:33.519
lived in rivers and lakes before.

30:34.079 --> 30:35.480
If I try

30:35.480 --> 30:36.480
to create

30:36.480 --> 30:37.880
a familiar environment for it,

30:37.880 --> 30:38.960
with moonlight and fallen trees,

30:39.480 --> 30:41.279
making it believe that it's still

30:41.279 --> 30:43.119
in a mountain stream,

30:43.119 --> 30:44.839
perhaps it will then show itself.

30:59.000 --> 31:01.720
Little tricks to deceive
both humans and animals.

31:01.720 --> 31:03.200
Indeed, you are of this talent.

31:04.440 --> 31:07.000
As a Floral Envoy,
you don't know how to tame a fish.

31:07.000 --> 31:08.960
Indeed, you are a charlatan.

31:11.480 --> 31:12.680
You have the talent for business,

31:12.680 --> 31:13.880
and know how to be a merchant.

31:13.880 --> 31:15.599
You surely know selling fresh flowers

31:15.599 --> 31:17.400
comes with high costs and risks.

31:18.200 --> 31:20.160
Why not pursue
another line of work to earn money?

31:21.400 --> 31:23.359
You present tribute and gadgets to His Majesty,

31:23.359 --> 31:25.160
naturally, should evaluate
the value of everything.

31:25.839 --> 31:27.200
But I

31:27.200 --> 31:28.880
grow and sell flowers.

31:28.880 --> 31:30.359
It's all because I love it.

31:30.359 --> 31:31.400
I do as I please.

31:33.000 --> 31:34.319
As for me,

31:34.319 --> 31:36.359
the peony flowers are

31:36.359 --> 31:37.960
the most precious things in this world.

31:39.640 --> 31:41.279
The peony flowers are delicate and fragile,

31:41.279 --> 31:42.720
of no use,

31:42.720 --> 31:44.640
merely a beautiful plaything
without any practical use.

31:45.440 --> 31:46.920
Why are you so obsessed with them?

31:48.880 --> 31:50.759
Regardless of
what they have been through before,

31:51.440 --> 31:52.480
as long as

31:52.480 --> 31:53.519
they are replanted into

31:53.519 --> 31:54.880
the soil,

31:54.880 --> 31:56.279
they will take root again

31:56.279 --> 31:57.319
and grow towards the sun.

31:58.200 --> 31:59.759
Every time I see these,

31:59.759 --> 32:01.359
a surge of power wells up in my heart

32:01.359 --> 32:02.559
to start over again.

32:07.200 --> 32:08.279
People said that only those who are useful

32:08.279 --> 32:09.960
can appreciate the beauty
of what's deemed useless.

32:09.960 --> 32:11.480
In that case,

32:11.480 --> 32:13.200
are you useful

32:13.200 --> 32:14.200
or useless?

32:16.640 --> 32:18.319
You talk so mean,

32:18.319 --> 32:19.720
making me a headache.

32:21.160 --> 32:22.440
Is this fish coming or not?

32:23.720 --> 32:26.039
Yes, I suppose.

32:26.640 --> 32:28.200
Let's wait a bit more.

32:30.920 --> 32:32.279
Is it beneath here?

32:43.160 --> 32:44.839
It seems to be on this side.

32:44.839 --> 32:46.799
I saw it.

32:46.799 --> 32:48.136
So small?

32:53.559 --> 32:55.080
It's useful, right?

33:08.319 --> 33:09.559
Shengyi.

33:09.559 --> 33:10.599
- I have something…
- This is for you.

33:17.039 --> 33:18.504
Thank you, Shengyi.

33:19.200 --> 33:20.880
If it weren't for me,

33:20.880 --> 33:23.079
Wang Qing would not have
taken his revenge on you,

33:23.079 --> 33:24.759
and your effort would have not gone in vain.

33:25.599 --> 33:26.640
Mudan.

33:26.640 --> 33:28.359
I am sorry.

33:28.359 --> 33:29.720
What are you talking about?

33:29.720 --> 33:31.559
Come on, have a seat, Shengyi.

33:33.759 --> 33:34.880
Remember.

33:34.880 --> 33:36.519
There's no need for apologies between us.

33:37.400 --> 33:38.440
Moreover,

33:38.440 --> 33:40.759
the root cause of the flower's failure
lies with me.

33:40.759 --> 33:42.359
It's good to learn a lesson.

33:44.119 --> 33:45.119
Don't worry.

33:45.119 --> 33:46.759
I will try to improve

33:46.759 --> 33:48.359
the last batch of Huaixiuxiang.

33:48.359 --> 33:49.599
If we can get enough nutrient to them

33:49.599 --> 33:50.640
to extend the blooming period,

33:50.640 --> 33:52.279
perhaps we can also sell them.

33:53.359 --> 33:54.960
But our money

33:54.960 --> 33:56.200
is either lost to the customers,

33:56.200 --> 33:58.680
or used to purchase new peony varieties.

33:58.680 --> 33:59.839
The Chunyiwan is still waiting

33:59.839 --> 34:01.640
for the last fertilization.

34:01.640 --> 34:02.960
We have

34:02.960 --> 34:04.720
no extra money to use.

34:04.720 --> 34:06.759
How can we go on this business?

34:07.559 --> 34:09.599
We have just started doing business.

34:09.599 --> 34:11.559
We can't give up once we face difficulty.

34:11.559 --> 34:12.800
There will always be a solution.

34:14.480 --> 34:15.480
Right.

34:15.480 --> 34:17.039
Madam Sun from yesterday

34:17.039 --> 34:18.239
is so kind.

34:18.239 --> 34:19.519
When we have the time,

34:19.519 --> 34:20.719
let's go thank her properly.

34:21.679 --> 34:23.679
She seems to sell incense powder

34:23.679 --> 34:25.440
in the West Market,

34:25.440 --> 34:26.519
not far from us.

34:27.400 --> 34:29.032
Incense powder?

34:30.400 --> 34:31.920
If we turn the withered flowers

34:31.920 --> 34:33.079
all into incense powder,

34:33.639 --> 34:35.000
then we could earn back

34:35.000 --> 34:36.559
the money for Chunyiwan fertilization?

34:37.719 --> 34:39.079
Shengyi, now

34:39.079 --> 34:40.639
let's go find Madam Sun

34:40.639 --> 34:42.679
and ask her how to make incense powder.

34:44.440 --> 34:45.544
Let's go.

34:46.440 --> 34:47.480
Shengyi, thank you

34:47.480 --> 34:48.760
for reminding me.

34:48.760 --> 34:51.320
You have a lot of ideas.

34:51.320 --> 34:52.880
Baked cakes,

34:52.880 --> 34:54.639
crispy and delicious.

34:54.639 --> 34:56.039
Ceramic utensils for sale.

34:56.039 --> 34:57.599
Baked cakes,

34:57.599 --> 34:59.559
crispy and delicious.

35:00.440 --> 35:01.960
Come and take a look.

35:02.559 --> 35:04.039
Seasonal fresh flowers for sale.

35:04.039 --> 35:05.440
Peonies and azaleas.

35:05.440 --> 35:07.719
Suitable for both viewing and wearing.

35:07.719 --> 35:09.360
Madam, there is new incense powder today.

35:11.280 --> 35:13.920
Madam, your incense powder
is really fine and smooth.

35:15.039 --> 35:16.239
It's you two.

35:17.679 --> 35:19.239
But the clove and yulan magnolia

35:19.239 --> 35:20.480
are being used by everyone.

35:20.480 --> 35:22.000
I'm afraid that people might find it boring,

35:22.000 --> 35:23.599
that's why causes the poor business.

35:23.599 --> 35:24.679
What a pity.

35:26.880 --> 35:28.639
I'm truly sorry.

35:28.639 --> 35:30.719
Yesterday, I didn't mean
to put you two in a difficult position.

35:31.480 --> 35:34.039
But I am indeed short of money.

35:34.039 --> 35:36.480
Madam, it was I who wanted
to refund the money for the flowers yesterday.

35:36.480 --> 35:37.679
It has nothing to do with you.

35:37.679 --> 35:38.760
Don't feel guilty.

35:41.559 --> 35:43.119
Ladies,

35:43.119 --> 35:44.320
do you want to buy incense powder?

35:46.480 --> 35:47.480
You can take any

35:47.480 --> 35:48.599
on this stall.

35:48.599 --> 35:51.119
After all, I'm also going to close down.

35:51.119 --> 35:52.159
Might as well give them to you

35:52.159 --> 35:53.159
as a gift.

35:53.840 --> 35:54.960
Take it.

35:54.960 --> 35:56.480
Madam, no need.

35:57.039 --> 35:59.639
Our visit today is for two matters.

36:00.239 --> 36:01.519
Just call me Mudan.

36:02.320 --> 36:03.440
First is to express gratitude

36:03.440 --> 36:05.199
for your tolerance towards us yesterday.

36:05.199 --> 36:06.280
Second,

36:06.280 --> 36:08.199
we would like to ask for your guidance

36:08.199 --> 36:09.400
on how to make incense powder.

36:11.639 --> 36:13.440
Since your business

36:13.440 --> 36:14.719
is not that good,

36:14.719 --> 36:16.199
why not

36:16.199 --> 36:17.280
cooperate with us?

36:20.440 --> 36:22.000
Peonies are expensive
and have a light fragrance,

36:22.000 --> 36:23.639
so no one uses them for making incense.

36:23.639 --> 36:25.320
But the Huaixiuxiang

36:25.320 --> 36:26.920
has a rich and pleasant fragrance.

36:26.920 --> 36:28.424
Take a whiff.

36:29.360 --> 36:30.800
If we develop a product with this,

36:30.800 --> 36:32.320
we will definitely stand out

36:32.320 --> 36:33.360
and double the product price.

36:34.239 --> 36:36.519
Madam, you have the skill of making incense,

36:36.519 --> 36:38.360
and we have incense materials.

36:38.360 --> 36:39.559
We can develop

36:39.559 --> 36:40.639
peony incense powder together.

36:40.639 --> 36:42.880
Even if you are closing your stall,
it doesn't matter.

36:42.880 --> 36:44.119
My stall is vacant.

36:44.119 --> 36:45.719
You can go there to sell.

36:46.679 --> 36:47.719
Mudan.

36:47.719 --> 36:48.960
I understood

36:48.960 --> 36:50.239
what you mean.

36:50.800 --> 36:52.296
Very good.

36:54.559 --> 36:55.559
However,

36:55.559 --> 36:57.760
you know what happened yesterday.

36:57.760 --> 36:59.960
Now, we can't afford the down payment.

37:00.719 --> 37:02.159
But if you trust me,

37:02.159 --> 37:03.960
I will write a contract right now.

37:03.960 --> 37:05.679
After the peony incense powder is sold,

37:05.679 --> 37:07.304
I will repay your money.

37:08.360 --> 37:09.599
Mudan.

37:09.599 --> 37:11.239
You are smart and reliable.

37:11.239 --> 37:12.840
What have I to worry about?

37:13.719 --> 37:15.840
The cooperation you just mentioned is feasible,

37:16.920 --> 37:18.119
but…

37:18.119 --> 37:19.639
I have a favor to ask.

37:19.639 --> 37:22.360
Mother.

37:25.079 --> 37:26.159
Mother, I'm back.

37:34.679 --> 37:36.159
This is my daughter, Fu.

37:37.239 --> 37:39.719
She is frank and kind,

37:39.719 --> 37:40.880
usually helps out at the stall,

37:40.880 --> 37:42.280
assisting me.

37:43.079 --> 37:44.559
I wonder if you two

37:44.559 --> 37:46.800
could take her with you and work together,

37:47.480 --> 37:48.840
to temper her character

37:48.840 --> 37:50.320
and teach her how to do business.

37:50.320 --> 37:51.639
Do…

37:51.639 --> 37:53.719
Although she is not eloquent,

37:53.719 --> 37:54.840
she is hardworking and diligent,

37:54.840 --> 37:56.440
certainly will not disappoint you.

37:58.400 --> 37:59.639
Mind your manners.

38:03.960 --> 38:05.280
My name is…

38:06.159 --> 38:08.199
Smile.

38:15.039 --> 38:17.199
My name is Zhu Fu.

38:18.280 --> 38:19.760
Greetings.

38:21.960 --> 38:23.280
For the incense powder business,

38:23.280 --> 38:24.760
we are still novices.

38:24.760 --> 38:26.559
We will need your guidance in the future.

38:27.880 --> 38:29.159
In the past at the stall,

38:29.159 --> 38:30.559
what were you responsible for?

38:30.559 --> 38:32.039
I prepare incense.

38:32.039 --> 38:34.199
I am naturally strong and adept at
cutting, pounding, grinding, and filing.

38:34.199 --> 38:35.400
All the incense here…

38:38.119 --> 38:39.480
Compared to other women,

38:39.480 --> 38:40.760
she is stronger.

38:40.760 --> 38:42.039
Any physical labor,

38:42.039 --> 38:43.159
just leave it to her.

38:44.159 --> 38:45.920
She is also good at blending scents.

38:45.920 --> 38:47.400
She can distinguish

38:47.400 --> 38:49.760
the smells of all kinds of incense materials.

38:49.760 --> 38:51.199
If she's that amazing,

38:52.840 --> 38:54.199
I wonder if you can smell

38:54.199 --> 38:55.679
what the sachet in my hand

38:55.679 --> 38:57.079
is made of.

38:57.079 --> 38:58.639
This is the sachet you gave me,

38:58.639 --> 39:00.199
and it disappeared yesterday.

39:00.199 --> 39:01.760
I thought I had lost it.

39:03.320 --> 39:04.480
Last night, you've

39:04.480 --> 39:06.079
spent the night with me,

39:06.880 --> 39:08.159
very joyously.

39:08.159 --> 39:09.679
Even you left

39:09.679 --> 39:11.000
your personal belonging.

39:11.000 --> 39:13.199
Today I came specially to return it.

39:13.199 --> 39:15.880
And I thought to give you more money

39:15.880 --> 39:17.400
to spend the night together again.

39:18.119 --> 39:19.719
So, this flower-selling woman

39:19.719 --> 39:21.480
is selling her body.

39:22.719 --> 39:24.280
Selling flowers is just a front,

39:24.280 --> 39:26.239
but selling her body is the reality.

39:26.239 --> 39:28.840
Remember them. They are

39:29.400 --> 39:31.159
cheaper than those

39:31.159 --> 39:32.280
from the brothels.

39:34.239 --> 39:35.559
This matter started because of me.

39:35.559 --> 39:37.599
I'll go explain to him. You go…

39:37.599 --> 39:39.239
It was Wang Qing who sent you, wasn't it?

39:39.239 --> 39:42.880
Failing to provoke trouble,
then slandering her, how despicable!

39:47.280 --> 39:48.519
Your body is surrounded
by the seductive incense

39:48.519 --> 39:50.280
made of cardamun vanilla, and ambergris.

39:50.280 --> 39:52.320
Only the courtesans use this incense.

39:52.320 --> 39:55.159
Last night, you were seeking pleasure
in Pingkang House.

39:55.159 --> 39:56.280
You scoundrel!

39:56.280 --> 39:57.840
How dare you to ruin her reputation!

39:57.840 --> 39:59.440
Watch me break your legs.

40:01.039 --> 40:03.440
Murder! Someone's killing!

40:03.440 --> 40:04.760
Come back! I'll…

40:06.559 --> 40:07.639
Kneel down.

40:07.639 --> 40:09.280
Madam, don't.

40:11.000 --> 40:12.199
- Do you know you're wrong?
- Yes.

40:12.199 --> 40:14.000
- What did you do wrong?
- I should've broken his legs first,

40:14.000 --> 40:15.079
then he couldn't have run away.

40:15.079 --> 40:16.760
How dare you!

40:16.760 --> 40:18.199
You are pissing me off.

40:18.719 --> 40:20.360
What did you say to me earlier?

40:21.079 --> 40:22.519
To properly learn how to do business

40:22.519 --> 40:24.000
and stop learning martial arts

40:24.000 --> 40:25.119
and causing trouble.

40:25.719 --> 40:26.960
I've finally found you

40:26.960 --> 40:28.079
a master.

40:28.079 --> 40:30.079
If you still act like this,

40:30.079 --> 40:31.360
who dares take you in?

40:31.360 --> 40:32.519
I have already said

40:32.519 --> 40:34.039
I've never wanted to do business.

40:34.039 --> 40:35.239
I just want to venture the world

40:35.239 --> 40:36.239
to uphold justice,

40:36.239 --> 40:37.280
just like it's written in the legends.

40:37.280 --> 40:38.800
What did you say?

40:38.800 --> 40:40.760
- Madam, don't.
- Madam, please stop.

40:40.760 --> 40:42.248
Don't hit her.

40:43.199 --> 40:44.639
Fu is an extraordinary woman.

40:44.639 --> 40:45.800
When we interact,

40:45.800 --> 40:46.960
it will certainly be of fun.

40:46.960 --> 40:48.480
Yes.

40:48.480 --> 40:49.880
You don't find me rude and impolite?

40:50.880 --> 40:52.000
Of course not.

40:52.000 --> 40:54.159
On the contrary,
I find you honest and charming.

40:54.159 --> 40:55.199
And you eliminate harm for the people,

40:55.800 --> 40:57.599
like a heroine of an era.

40:58.320 --> 40:59.360
Heroine?

41:02.880 --> 41:03.880
As the saying goes,

41:03.880 --> 41:05.400
one is hard to find the one who admires him.

41:05.400 --> 41:06.472
I think

41:07.559 --> 41:09.400
you are the one.

41:09.400 --> 41:11.679
No, no, no.

41:13.559 --> 41:14.760
Madam.

41:14.760 --> 41:15.880
I really like

41:15.880 --> 41:17.239
Fu.

41:17.239 --> 41:19.519
I will surely take good care of her.

41:19.519 --> 41:20.800
Mudan.

41:20.800 --> 41:22.039
You are willing to take in Fu.

41:22.039 --> 41:23.519
That's great.

41:24.079 --> 41:25.639
Your name is Mudan?

41:26.400 --> 41:28.039
Just call me Fu.

41:28.039 --> 41:29.159
You are…

41:29.159 --> 41:30.480
My name is Shengyi.

41:30.480 --> 41:32.000
Shengyi.

41:32.000 --> 41:33.119
What a pleasant name.

41:33.119 --> 41:34.920
From now on, we are friends.

41:34.920 --> 41:36.280
If anyone dares to bully you,

41:36.280 --> 41:37.480
they'll answer to my fists.

41:59.198 --> 42:05.472
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:07.326 --> 42:14.010
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:14.686 --> 42:21.884
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:22.878 --> 42:31.230
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:31.230 --> 42:38.773
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:39.427 --> 42:47.614
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:47.614 --> 42:55.425
<♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

42:56.030 --> 43:03.322
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:23.998 --> 43:30.881
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:32.182 --> 43:38.876
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the fragrant garden ♫

43:39.633 --> 43:46.935
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:47.619 --> 43:55.928
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

43:55.928 --> 44:03.359
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:04.190 --> 44:12.446
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:12.446 --> 44:19.870
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:20.874 --> 44:28.324
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
